    "text": "By Richard M. Sullivan ,\n7 hours ago A 44-year-old Memphis, Tennessee man is facing a domestic battery charge after witnesses told Gurnee police he battered his wife multiple times in full view of other visitors at Six Flags Great America. Timothy Baldridge Jr. was arrested on Aug. 8 following the incident, which allegedly unfolded near the Superman ride as hundreds of people moved through the park. Read full article\n4",
